title: Economic Democracy
subtitle: Industry and Trade: works councils, cooperatives and the socialisation of mining.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: govt_affairs
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && PolishProjects.cardAvailable(Q, 'economic_democracy') !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card government.economic_democracy (technical reference 17.11–17.12). Z — 0.94 (the user's decisions of 24 X 2026; P): a card
// of Industry and Trade after the German card “Economic Democracy” — the law on works councils, the state credit of the cooperatives
