PolishProjects.cardView(Q, 'economic_democracy');
Q.pl_gc_ministry = PolishProjects.ministryLine(Q, 'polish_gov_economic_democracy');
!}

= Economic democracy

*[+ pl_gc_ministry +]*

Socialists want the workers to have a say in the plants and the economy to serve those who work. Every step in this direction meets the resistance of the employers.

[+ pl_gc_budget +]

[+ pl_gc_projects +]

- @works_councils
- @cooperative_credit
- @socialise_mining
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@works_councils
title: Introduce the law on works councils
subtitle: A law in the Sejm: in the larger plants workers’ councils have a say on dismissals and the wage rules. The workers are less discontented (−3) and trust their unions more (+5), but business presses harder (+8).
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'economic_democracy', 'works_councils').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_economic_democracy_works_councils_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'economic_democracy', 'works_councils');
!}
go-to: result

@cooperative_credit
title: Support the cooperatives with state credit
subtitle: Costs 1 budget unit a month. The workers trust PPS more (+3), but the small traders whose customers the cooperatives take trust us less (−3).
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'economic_democracy', 'cooperative_credit').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_economic_democracy_cooperative_credit_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'economic_democracy', 'cooperative_credit');
!}
go-to: result

@socialise_mining
title: Socialise coal mining
subtitle: A law in the Sejm, once in the game; compensation for the owners costs 2 budget units a month for six months. The miners’ unions trust the party more and the dissent of the Left of PPS falls (−5), but business pressure jumps (+25).
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'economic_democracy', 'socialise_mining').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_economic_democracy_socialise_mining_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'economic_democracy', 'socialise_mining');
!}
go-to: result

@result
new-page: true

